    "alert_id": "EX3_003",
    "title": "Viral load monitoring overdue per guideline schedule",
    "message": "Guidelines state patients on DTG-based first-line ART should have VL checked every 6 months, reducible to 12 monthly if VL <50 for >1 year with reliable adherence. Last VL was <50 on 2025-11-10, 106 days ago. While not yet critically overdue, no VL is ordered in today's plan. If the clinician is considering switching DTG, confirming virological suppression before any regimen change is essential.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
